# Life node, March to October, fallback only: the dawn window from 05:00 for 6 hours and the dusk window from 20:00 for
# 2 hours, at fixed local clock time. life-schedule writes the schedule computed for the node's place instead, and uses
# this file only if that computation fails
BEGIN	2026-03-01 05:00:00
END	2035-12-31 23:59:59
ON	H6
OFF	H9
ON	H2
OFF	H7
